		(property "Description" "On-board 0.96in 128x64 SSD1306 I2C OLED module (generic 4-pin, I2C 0x3C) plugged into a 1x04 2.54mm female socket: 1 GND 2 +3V3 3 SCL 4 SDA. Held by the socket; the footprint has no standoff holes, only four 4.0mm keep-out areas where M2 holes can be added. Check the module's pin order (some are VCC-GND) before fitting. Socket: BOOMELE 2.54-1*4P (LCSC); Vendor PN S7002-ND is the equivalent Sullins PPTC041LFBN-RC."
